      "sourceTextSha256": "339b0fd990db3881570e5facc9a0491988f1a241af24f6c3fba0d9afb54590e0",
      "text": "Today’s tour takes you through the historic and cultural core of Mexico City, where ancient Aztec foundations, colonial architecture, and modern city life coexist.\n\nToday you leave behind the vibrant energy of Mexico City and travel to Mérida, the elegant and sun-drenched capital of the Yucatán Peninsula, often called La Ciudad Blanca (The White City).\n\nStep into the fascinating world of the Ancient Maya during today’s excursion to some of the most impressive archaeological sites in the Yucatán region.\n\nToday’s journey connects the ancient world of the Maya with the turquoise waters of the Caribbean coast.",
